WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.447
Grain means the meaning of one row.

00:00:03.447 --> 00:00:07.307
A transaction table may have one row per sale.

00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:12.707
After grouping, the grain may become one row per product per month.

00:00:12.707 --> 00:00:18.762
After pivoting months into columns, the grain may become one row per product.

00:00:18.762 --> 00:00:26.164
If you cannot clearly say what one row represents, it is very difficult to know whether your result is correct.
